# You do not need this file. `npm run setup` creates the only .env you need.
# Everything below is optional — uncomment a line to override a default.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Which brain?
#
#  Left unset it works this out on its own: an API key if you have one,
#  otherwise your Claude subscription via a locally logged-in Claude Code.
#
#    claude-code  → your Claude Pro/Max SUBSCRIPTION. No API key, no metered
#                   billing. Run `claude` once to sign in first.
#    anthropic    → Anthropic API key (billed per token, separate from Max)
#    openai       → OpenAI API key (billed per token, separate from Plus)
#
#  Neither a Claude Max plan nor ChatGPT Plus includes API access — they are
#  separate products. To use those subscriptions instead, see
#  docs/SUBSCRIPTIONS.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BRAIN_PROVIDER=claude-code

# --- Claude subscription route (BRAIN_PROVIDER=claude-code) ---
# Empty means "whatever Claude Code is already set to".
# CLAUDE_CODE_MODEL=
# CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT=
# CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_TURNS=16

# --- Claude API (console.anthropic.com) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Any current model id. Opus 5 is the default and the most capable.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# low | medium | high | xhigh | max  — how hard it thinks per turn
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=high

# --- OpenAI API (platform.openai.com) ---
# Also used for embeddings + high-quality voice even when Claude is the brain.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
# OPENAI_EMBED_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
# OPENAI_TTS_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini-tts
# OPENAI_TTS_VOICE=alloy

# --- Server ---
# One port serves the UI, the API, and the /mcp connector endpoint.
# PORT=8787
# Where the brain keeps its memories (JSON, auto-created)
# DATA_DIR=./data

# Name it. It'll answer to this.
# BRAIN_NAME=Atlas

# --- Connecting Claude / ChatGPT to the graph ---
# `npm run setup` writes MCP_TOKEN for you; you rarely need to touch this block.
#
# Bearer token for the connector endpoint at http://localhost:8787/mcp.
# Always required — without one, a random token is generated at each boot and
# your ChatGPT connector stops working on restart.
# MCP_TOKEN=
# Where the stdio MCP server (Claude Desktop / Claude Code) finds this app.
# BRAIN_APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
